{"about_the_game":"<strong>SpaceFlight Factory</strong> is an <strong>Automation and (moving) Base Building</strong> inspired by Factorio and Stardeus.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/6ff92a43e9135b90fdc85a443da3b827.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/6ff92a43e9135b90fdc85a443da3b827.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/6ff92a43e9135b90fdc85a443da3b827.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>On a post-apocalyptic Earth, all cities and settlements have been ravaged by pollution and a hostile biosphere.<br>In a last hope to salvage Earth, a crew of the best astronauts have been sent to a remote planet to collect a mysterious ore capable of turning Earth's destiny.<br><br>Rebuild an assembly line with conveyor belts, factory(s), foundry(s), insertor(s)... while defending your base from nearby swarms of Zorglings and rebuild an industry capable of launching spacecrafts and sending the supplies back to Earth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/3048f56c9aaaf90e8cae634d8d9fc00b.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/3048f56c9aaaf90e8cae634d8d9fc00b.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/3048f56c9aaaf90e8cae634d8d9fc00b.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With this new hope, <strong>you lead a colony of human remnants. Help them survive, expand and gather enough resources to leave Earth for their new home planet..</strong>. The game also includes some incremental/idle game mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/0c9ee75b81694362267c048addc65693.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=646 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/0c9ee75b81694362267c048addc65693.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/0c9ee75b81694362267c048addc65693.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1358970?t=1699560229","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1358970?t=1699560229","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1699560229","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1699560229","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Support and follow the game</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/df15769c4d5d3f032d8aaddff0413f67.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=558 height=48 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/df15769c4d5d3f032d8aaddff0413f67.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/df15769c4d5d3f032d8aaddff0413f67.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <br>If you're interested in SpaceFlight Factory, please take a moment to add it to your Steam Wishlist. This small action really helps us out, and is totally free. This way, you will also get updates about when the game is released</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>SpaceFlight Factory</strong> is an <strong>Automation and (moving) Base Building</strong> inspired by Factorio and Stardeus.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/6ff92a43e9135b90fdc85a443da3b827.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/6ff92a43e9135b90fdc85a443da3b827.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/6ff92a43e9135b90fdc85a443da3b827.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>On a post-apocalyptic Earth, all cities and settlements have been ravaged by pollution and a hostile biosphere.<br>In a last hope to salvage Earth, a crew of the best astronauts have been sent to a remote planet to collect a mysterious ore capable of turning Earth's destiny.<br><br>Rebuild an assembly line with conveyor belts, factory(s), foundry(s), insertor(s)... while defending your base from nearby swarms of Zorglings and rebuild an industry capable of launching spacecrafts and sending the supplies back to Earth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/3048f56c9aaaf90e8cae634d8d9fc00b.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=668 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/3048f56c9aaaf90e8cae634d8d9fc00b.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/3048f56c9aaaf90e8cae634d8d9fc00b.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With this new hope, <strong>you lead a colony of human remnants. Help them survive, expand and gather enough resources to leave Earth for their new home planet..</strong>. The game also includes some incremental/idle game mechanics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/0c9ee75b81694362267c048addc65693.poster.avif?t=1699560229\" width=646 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/0c9ee75b81694362267c048addc65693.webm?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/extras/0c9ee75b81694362267c048addc65693.mp4?t=1699560229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Kanapper"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358970/header.jpg?t=1699560229","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Kanapper","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1358970/527298/16d584ce1dc86ad262484